 #10090698 (shekitten) & #10090886 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"Mis gatas son mis hijas.","en":"My cats are my children.","ch":3,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10090762 (shekitten) & #10091131 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"No he hecho eso hoy.","en":"I haven't done that today.","ch":4,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10092431 (ddnktr) & #10092964 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"Estuve en su casa ayer.","en":"I was at his house yesterday.","ch":5,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10087186 (ddnktr) & #10093068 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"Sé que no me quieren.","en":"I know they don't love me.","ch":3,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10087034 (ddnktr) & #10093101 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"¿Cuándo se escribió este libro?","en":"When was this book written?","ch":5,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10093033 (ddnktr) & #10093214 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"¿Crees que él me perdonará?","en":"Do you think he'll forgive me?","ch":7,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10069800 (ddnktr) & #10093267 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"¿Le dijeron eso a ella?","en":"Did they say that to her?","ch":5,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10069705 (ddnktr) & #10093279 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"Come tanta comida como quieras.","en":"Eat as much food as you want.","ch":9,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10093696 (espamatics) & #10093697 (Shishir)"},{"es":"Quiero un perro como ese.","en":"I want a dog like that one.","ch":3,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10095819 (CK) & #10097453 (manufrutos)"},{"es":"No puedo seguir haciendo esto.","en":"I can't keep doing this.","ch":6,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #953395 (CK) & #1010155 (Shishir)"},{"es":"Se ha ido la luz.","en":"The power went out.","ch":4,"src":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #480240 (minshirui) & #1010771 (hundo)"},{"es":"Creí que no querías venir.","en":"I thought you didn't want to come."